---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面未找到" description="您访问的页面不存在，请返回商盛源官网首页。" noindex={true}>
  <section class="nf">
    <div class="container nf__inner">
      <span class="nf__code num">404</span>
      <h1>这个页面暂时找不到了</h1>
      <p>您访问的链接可能已经调整。可以从首页重新出发，或直接查看课程与研学内容。</p>
      <div class="nf__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--navy" href="/">返回首页 →</a>
        <a class="btn btn--line" href="/courses">查看课程中心</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nf__links">
        <a href="/about">商盛源介绍</a>
        <a href="/yanxue">胖东来研学</a>
        <a href="/guide">研学指南</a>
        <a href="/contact">咨询沟通</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .nf { min-height: 62vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--paper-warm); padding: 80px 0; }
  .nf__inner { text-align: center; }
  .nf__code { display: block; font-size: clamp(5rem, 14vw, 9rem); line-height: 1; color: var(--gold); }
  .nf h1 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem); margin: 10px 0 14px; }
  .nf p { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.9; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .nf__actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .nf__links { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 22px; margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .nf__links a { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .nf__links a:hover { color: var(--gold-deep); }
</style>
